OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 86, dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 86-year-old woman has died after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a car, with police
OL,8,Fappealing for witnesses.
OL,10,FSurrey Police said the woman was
OL,11,Fpronounced dead at the scene of the
OL,12,Fcrash on the A281 in Alford, near
OL,13,FDunsfold, shortly before 17:15 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FThe driver of a blue BMW involved in
OL,17,Fthe crash was seriously injured and is
OL,18,Fbeing treated in hospital.
OL,20,FA force spokesperson says the road has
OL,21,Freopened following the collision, after
OL,22,Fseveral hours of investigations.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
